 ## Summary
 
-Detailed reference for the BBPOS WisePOS E — countertop smart reader. 24 countries (no JP). Internet connection. All 5 SDKs + server-driven (server-driven recommended). 4-component software (same structure as S700/S710).
+The May 1 and November 7, 2026 guides cover the BBPOS WisePOS E countertop reader, its diagnostics, and its Stripe-managed software. They list JavaScript, iOS, Android and React Native SDKs plus the recommended server-driven integration, which uses the Stripe API.
 
-## Key Details vs S700/S710
+The reader software communicates directly with Stripe. The separate November model setup guide explains that the POS app uses the same local network as the reader with a Terminal SDK, or communicates over the internet with server-driven integration. See [[raw/stripe-terminal-payments-setup-reader-bbpos-wisepos-e-2026-11-07|November 7 model-setup capture]], lines 63–65.
 
-**Firmware**: `5.01.03.00` (AU has `.eftpos` suffix). PCI format: `WSC5x.11-WXYZZ-ABCDD`.
